OL,3,GNEWSABaby memorial vandalism
OL,4,A'incredibly upsetting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital garden created as a memorial
OL,7,Fto babies that have died has been
OL,8,Fvandalised.
OL,10,FWye Valley NHS Trust Charity posted on
OL,11,FFacebook to say the incident at
OL,12,FHereford County Hospital had happened
OL,13,Fovernight on Saturday into Sunday.
OL,15,F"This is a charitable project created
OL,16,Fwith love, compassion and the hope of
OL,17,Fproviding a peaceful place for families
OL,18,Fto remember their precious babies," it
OL,19,Fsaid.
